From: idiazraz <100824525+idiazraz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 20:17:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] airoha: xpon: Nokia OMCI fixes, OLT-G seed and GPON identity
 hold

Patch 9993: answer the Nokia ALCL audits and seed the MEs it expects.
Patch 9994: seed OLT-G on every profile, so the OLT can name itself and
auto detection can pick a profile. Keep its identity across MIB resets.
Patch 9995: hold the GPON MAC until the identity has been applied.
---
 ...mci-nokia-alcl-audits-and-seeded-mes.patch | 131 +++++++++++++++++
 ...eed-OLT-G-so-the-OLT-can-name-itself.patch | 139 ++++++++++++++++++
 ...ON-MAC-until-the-identity-is-applied.patch | 122 +++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 392 insertions(+)
